• Ocean Conservation (SDG 14): Ocean protection and sustainable marine use are core pillars of Portugal's UN engagement and global diplomacy.
• Local and Lusophone Cooperation (SDGs 10 & 17): Initiatives like SDSN Portugal's UNI-MUNICÍPIOS pair universities with municipalities on local sustainability challenges, while outreach extends to Portuguese-speaking African nations (PALOP) through university networks and debt-for-climate agreements such as with Cabo Verde.

